## BACKGROUNDS PINAPP — CRÉÉS PAR LAURALIE

```
FICHIERS OBLIGATOIRES dans /assets/images/ :
bg-sombre.webp → mode sombre (teal/violet Pandora nuit)
bg-clair.webp  → mode clair  (lavande/soleil Pandora aube)
Format : WebP / ≤300Ko chacun

INTÉGRATION CSS dans variables.css :

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  body {
    background-image: url('/assets/images/bg-sombre.webp');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: fixed;
  }
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0;
    background: rgba(6,13,26,0.65);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
}

@media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
  body {
    background-image: url('/assets/images/bg-clair.webp');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: fixed;
  }
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0;
    background: rgba(240,235,248,0.55);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
}

/* iOS Safari fix — background-attachment: fixed cassé */
@supports (-webkit-touch-callout: none) {
  body {
    background-attachment: scroll;
  }
}

/* Transition entre modes */
body, body::before {
  transition: background-color 500ms ease,
              opacity 500ms ease;
}
```

TERMINOLOGIE OFFICIELLE :
"mode sombre" = dark (jamais "mode nuit")
"mode clair"  = light (jamais "mode jour")
Partout dans le code — sans exception.

