## FICHIERS DE CONFIGURATION

### .gitignore

```
.sftp.json
.env
.htpasswd
node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log
```

### .sftp.json

```json
{
  "host": "[HOSTINGER_FTP_HOST]",
  "username": "[HOSTINGER_FTP_USERNAME]",
  "password": "[HOSTINGER_FTP_PASSWORD]",
  "remotePath": "/public_html/",
  "uploadOnSave": true,
  "ignore": [".git",".cursorrules",".sftp.json",
             ".gitignore",".env","node_modules"]
}
```

